 "stop": "3 quatrains",
 "poem": "I thought I had seen the darkness\nThrough some small window of darkness,\nBut was startled by darkness\nI could not see--or hardly\nSee, though I saw it never!\nOh! let my shadow disappear!\nAnd feel no twilight, darkness,\nOr light or darkness again,\nBut just as day before,\nWith the sun through its diameter.\nFor there will be a great darkness,\nA night to wake again,",
